ded near Slocum Creek, marched north on the west bank of the Neuse, and attacked the Confederate line south of the Trent River and New Bern."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"map-actions","children":["$undefined",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Map source ",["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$d:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":13}]]}]]}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Interactive map: drag to pan and use the +/− controls to zoom."}]]}]]}],["$","figure","Official route map of the New Bern expedition",{"className":"reference-map","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"map-frame static-map-frame","children":["$","a",null,{"className":"map-image-link","href":"/projects/civil-war-field-companion/images/new-bern-route-map.jpg","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","aria-label":"Open Official route map of the New Bern expedition at full size","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/projects/civil-war-field-companion/images/new-bern-route-map.jpg","alt":"Official map showing the route of Burnside’s expedition and the Battle of New Bern","width":1600,"height":1200,"loading":"lazy"}]}]}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Official route map of the New Bern expedition"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"John G. Foster’s official map identifies the March 13 landing, the advance route, the battlefield, river obstructions, defensive works, and New Bern."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"map-actions","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/projects/civil-war-field-companion/images/new-bern-route-map.jpg","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Open full-size map ",["$","$Le",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$d:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":13}]]}],["$","a",null,{